description.text:
One single Lightning/NE piercing jump attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1] & [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & 30% DEF/RES Pierce to Lightning Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least 0/100% Critical Rate;
WS Blue: Grants [Critical Chance +100% & Critical Damage +50%] to user
WS Gold: Grants [During Tactical Awoken Mode, Lightning Ability Damage +50% & chases a Lightning ability with Quick ATB 2 to user (max 1 chase)] to user

